Subject: [experimental] Omit read translation for passes with no mapped reads

Opt-in DXMT_RATE_MAP_SELECTIVE_READ=1. Retain position translation and the
full fallback for any mapped read, geometry/tessellation and compute. Decide
after pass recording/merging; shader and PSO cache keys include the variant.

